          <h2 style="margin:0;font-family:Geist,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(30px,3.8vw,46px);line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-.035em;color:#1C130E;max-width:820px;text-wrap:balance"><span style="font-weight:400">How PriceLeap forecasts </span><span style="font-weight:700">a competitor's next move</span></h2>
