            <p style="margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:#3A302A">Years of observed price changes are decomposed per competitor into cadence, typical depth, preferred weekday and the events that tend to precede a move.</p>
            <p style="margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:#3A302A">Patterns are held per competitor and per category. A marketplace seller repricing hourly and a national retailer repricing monthly are never modelled the same way.</p>
