                  <div style="border:1px solid #F5ECE5;border-radius:12px;padding:10px"><div style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:9px;color:#7F7066">LEAD TIME</div><div style="font-family:Geist,sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;color:#1C130E">6 days</div></div>
