            <span style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px"><span style="width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;background:#1C130E;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">03</span><span style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#7F7066">STEP 03</span></span>
            <h3 style="margin:0;font-family:Geist,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(24px,2.6vw,32px);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:#1C130E">Pre-stage the response, then score the call</h3>
            <p style="margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:#3A302A">Forecasts above your threshold stage a price behind your existing rules and floors. It publishes on confirmation of the predicted move, or expires without touching anything.</p>
            <p style="margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:#3A302A">Every forecast is scored against what actually happened. Hit rate, timing error and depth error are reported per competitor and per horizon, and feed the next model run.</p>
