            <div style="padding:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;justify-content:center"><span style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#7F7066">[ CASE STUDY ]</span><span style="font-family:Geist,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.35;color:#1C130E">How [retailer] cut response time from X days to X hours by forecasting competitor moves</span><a href="#" style="font-weight:600;font-size:14px">Read the case study →</a></div>
