          <p style="margin:0;max-width:640px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#3A302A">Give us a category and the competitors you track. We'll backtest the forecast on the last 90 days, show the hit rate by horizon, and the moves the model would have called before they happened.</p>
